{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#card-zh","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-net-proxy**（DSH 网页插件）：为 agent 发起的网络请求配置 HTTP 或 SOCKS5 代理。它同时包装全局 fetch，并把代理策略同步到 web_fetch 使用的 harness 代理层；可跟随系统代理、配置绕过主机和连接参数，并在设置页查看请求日志、流量统计与图表。适合需要统一代理 DSH 网络流量并排查请求的用户。使用前需要一台可访问的代理服务器；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-80","lib/index.js:186-213","lib/harness-proxy.js:155-183","lib/client.js:1219-1250"]}
{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#card-en","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-net-proxy** routes DSH agent requests through HTTP or SOCKS5 proxies. It covers global fetch and web_fetch, can follow system proxy settings, and offers request logs and traffic charts in its settings UI. A reachable proxy is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-80","lib/index.js:186-213","lib/harness-proxy.js:155-183","lib/client.js:1219-1250"]}
