{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#feature-proxy","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 的功能「双通道代理」：把全局 fetch 请求转发到配置的代理，并同步安装到 web_fetch 使用的 harness 代理层。可选择 HTTP 或 SOCKS5，关闭或卸载时会清理相应策略。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-80","lib/harness-proxy.js:155-183"]}
{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#feature-system","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 的功能「跟随系统代理」：定期读取系统代理状态并合并到当前配置，在状态变化时刷新代理策略。用户可在配置中打开跟随模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:68-80","lib/index.js:218-235"]}
{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#feature-logs","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 的功能「请求流量记录」：记录经过插件的请求方法、URL、状态、耗时和流量，并提供内容预览与汇总；记录保存在进程内存中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/traffic-log.js:1-10","lib/traffic-log.js:134-145"]}
{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#feature-settings","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 的功能「代理设置与探测」：在 DSH 设置页修改代理配置或发起连通性探测，结果显示代理连接时间、整体耗时和目标 HTTP 状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:186-213","lib/probe.js:1-20"]}
