{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#caveat-logs","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 使用前须知：请求日志中的 URL 和文本预览可能包含业务内容，记录只保存在进程内存，不写入磁盘；可关闭日志或将预览字节设为 0。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/traffic-log.js:9-10","lib/index.js:23-38"]}
{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#caveat-tunnel","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 使用前须知：HTTPS CONNECT 隧道的加密内容不可见，日志仅记录目标和上下行字节；需检查加密请求内容时不能依赖该日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/traffic-log.js:3-10"]}
